  <Docs>
    <summary>Describes the Vulkan objects used to create a Vulkan-backed Graphite context.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Set the Vulkan instance, physical device, device, and queue, along with the graphics queue index and procedure-address delegate, before passing the context to <see cref="M:SkiaSharp.SKGraphiteContext.CreateVulkan(SkiaSharp.SKGraphiteVkBackendContext)" />. Dispose the context when no longer needed.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
